# FreeBrain — Cursor AI Rules

## Project
FreeBrain (freethebrains.com) — React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui marketing site for a neuro-therapy platform. Frontend-only. Fully i18n (en, es, de, pt).

## Tech Stack
- React 18, TypeScript 5, Vite 5, Tailwind CSS 3, shadcn/ui, react-i18next, react-router-dom, lucide-react

## Architecture
```
src/
├── pages/          ← Slim composition layers (routes). Import sections, not logic.
├── features/       ← Feature-specific sections + hooks (e.g., src/features/home/)
├── components/
│   ├── shared/     ← Cross-feature UI components
│   ├── ui/         ← shadcn primitives (DO NOT MODIFY)
│   └── layout/     ← Header, Footer
├── lib/            ← Utilities, constants, helpers
├── hooks/          ← Global hooks
├── locales/        ← i18n translations (en, es, de, pt)
└── types/          ← TypeScript types
```

## Rules (Non-Negotiable)
1. **Max 300 lines per file** — split if larger.
2. **One concern per file.** Pages are slim; they compose sections.
3. **No cross-feature imports** — use `src/components/shared/` or `src/lib/`.
4. **No hardcoded colors** — use semantic Tailwind tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`, etc.). Colors defined in `src/index.css`.
5. **No hardcoded user-facing text** — use `t()` from react-i18next. All 4 locale files must stay in sync.
6. **No dead code, no commented-out blocks, no console.log.**
7. **No `any` type** — use proper TypeScript types.
8. **Never break existing functionality** — verify all imports resolve, no props dropped.
9. **Never define React components inside other components.**
10. **Never modify `src/components/ui/`** — these are shadcn primitives.
11. **Name functions as verbs** (`fetchData`), **booleans as questions** (`isLoading`).
12. **Use early returns** to flatten nested conditionals.
13. **Refactor instead of stacking fallbacks** — 3rd fallback = stop and refactor.
14. **Trace the real code path** before making changes.

## i18n
- 4 languages: en (default), es, de, pt
- Browser language auto-detected, cached in localStorage
- Floating LanguageSwitcher component for manual override
- When adding/changing text: update ALL 4 locale files in `src/locales/{en,es,de,pt}/common.json`

## Design Tokens (src/index.css)
- `--brand-primary` (#3F3CD5), `--brand-accent` (#DE1261), `--brand-pink` (#FAAFCC)
- Semantic: `--background`, `--foreground`, `--primary`, `--secondary`, `--success`, `--warning`, `--danger`, `--info`, `--gold`

## Verification
```bash
npm run build
npx tsc --noEmit
npm run lint
```
